%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: ComposerDialogues_pachelbel_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0a0b07596da7acb4ea3b5e2f3f9f7092, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 2467484298437934
    m_Localized: Repeating a bass is an art. Making it shuffle in slippers is not.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437935
    m_Localized: Each turn should add something. This one merely adds minutes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437936
    m_Localized: All the voices enter together. Can they not queue?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437937
    m_Localized: The loop returns so empty it resembles a furniture-free removal
      van.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437938
    m_Localized: Those chords know each other, but have nothing to discuss.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437939
    m_Localized: A canon needs imitation. Here they merely imitate the copy button.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437940
    m_Localized: A bass can be constant without becoming a sleeping clerk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437941
    m_Localized: They garnished the repetition with a cymbal. What a meagre feast.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437942
    m_Localized: The progression completed a lap. Where is the new scenery?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437943
    m_Localized: If the theme must return, let it bring some news!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437944
    m_Localized: Each repetition added a detail. An impeccable inventory defeated
      me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437945
    m_Localized: The bass was steady and the voices grew. I cannot report sound construction
      as a crime.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437946
    m_Localized: That staggered entrance had charm. Defeat reached me in stages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437947
    m_Localized: The progression supported the melody well. I wish it had supported
      me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437948
    m_Localized: The loop knew how to renew itself. My protest became repetitive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437949
    m_Localized: I admit the layers built tension. Meanwhile, I built up problems.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437950
    m_Localized: The rhythmic variation was subtle. The consequence was quite obvious.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437951
    m_Localized: That return made sense. My victory, however, never returned.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437952
    m_Localized: They made the repeating bass sing. I dislike having my arguments
      stolen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437953
    m_Localized: The ending released the tension well. I still have some to release.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437954
    m_Localized: Repetition was not the problem. Doing nothing with it was!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437955
    m_Localized: The bass completed every lap. The music never left the garage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437956
    m_Localized: Victory! Now we can vary the facial expressions, at least.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437957
    m_Localized: The voices entered together and left defeated as a group.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437958
    m_Localized: That progression had places to go. They preferred a roundabout.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437959
    m_Localized: The loop is still waiting for a new idea. I already have the trophy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437960
    m_Localized: Another layer fixed nothing. Boredom can be stacked too!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437961
    m_Localized: The chorus brought no news. The result brings a big headline.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437962
    m_Localized: A steady pattern needs alert voices. These are still looking for
      the alarm clock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437963
    m_Localized: We have our final cadence. That was easier than finding a variation!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
